a en su contexto."],["listen","Escuchá una oración del texto.","The article presents evidence that urban trees can reduce summer heat.",["The article presents evidence that urban trees can reduce summer heat.","The shop opens at nine.","I haven't got any plans."],0,"Escuchá los detalles."],["dictation","Transcribí la frase escuchada.","The article presents evidence that urban trees can reduce summer heat.","Compará el texto exacto."],["order","Ordená una afirmación del texto.","The article presents evidence that urban trees can reduce summer heat.","Respetá las relaciones gramaticales."],["write","Resumí en inglés el texto en al menos 35 palabras. Incluí el resultado y una limitación.",{"min":35,"must":[],"model":"The passage describes a decision or finding and explains its possible effects. The available evidence is useful, but some limits remain. Before taking further action, the people involved should examine the information carefully."},"Separá observaciones de conclusiones."],["write","Redactá una recomendación de al menos 30 palabras que contemple incertidumbres.",{"min":30,"must":[],"model":"I would recommend reviewing the available evidence before making a final decision. Although the first results seem encouraging, additional information would help us understand potential risks and choose a suitable next step."},"Proponé una acción concreta y justificá su importancia."],["speak","Presentá oralmente una conclusión prudente.","The article presents evidence that urban trees can reduce summer heat.","Distinguí hechos de hipótesis."]]}
